Package: hsharp
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: HackerOS Team <hackeros068@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/HackerOS-Linux-System/H-Sharp
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34)
Description: H# programming language compiler and interpreter
 H# (h-sharp) is a compiled/interpreted programming language with an
 LLVM 21 backend for release builds and a tree-walking interpreter for
 `h# preview`/REPL use. This package installs the `hsharp` binary
 (also available as `h#`), providing compile, preview, check, fmt,
 repl, lsp, and new subcommands.
